! interfaces.d/eth0/egress/10.acl: everything going out makes an entry in
! the reflexive list MIRROR, which lets the replies back in (see
! reflexive-in.acl). Sessions end after 300 s idle (ip reflexive-list
! timeout), 5 s after a FIN or RST.
ip reflexive-list timeout 300
ip access-list extended OUTBOUND
 10 permit tcp any any reflect MIRROR
 20 permit udp any any reflect MIRROR timeout 30
 30 permit icmp any any reflect MIRROR timeout 10
 40 permit ip any any
